hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"978","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan key aakhri ashra mein etekaaf kartey they yahan tak ke Allah ne Aap ko faut kya. Phir Aap key baad Aapki biwiyon ne etekaaf kya. (Bukhari: 2026)"
"979","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Aur beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar merey paas daakhil kartey jabke Aap masjid mein hotey aur main unhey kanghi karti. Aur Aap ghar mein daakhil na hotey magar haajat key liye jab motakif hotey. (Bukhari: 2029)"
"980","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne jaahiliyat mein nazr maani thi ke Masjid-e-Haraam mein raat ko etekaaf karunga? Aap ne farmaya: To apni nazr poori karo. (Bukhari: 2032)"
"981","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne etekaaf ka iraada kya. Phir jab Aap us jagah ki taraf wapas aey jahaan Aap ne etekaaf ka iraada kya tha to khemey they: Aisha ka khema aur Hafsa ka khema aur Zainab ka khema. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum unkey sath neki kehtey ho? Phir Aap wapas aey aur etekaaf na kya yahan tak ke Shawwaal mein das (din) etekaaf kya. (Bukhari: 2034)"
"982","[AI-translation] Safiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke wo Ramazan key aakhri ashra mein masjid mein Aap key etekaaf mein Aap ki ziyaarat key liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaein. To Aap key paas ghadi bhar baat ki, phir khadi huin aur wapas jaaney lagein. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey sath unhey wapas karney key liye khadey huey. Yahan tak ke jab wo Umm Salma key darwaazey key paas masjid key darwaazey tak pahunchein to Ansaar mein se do aadmi guzrey aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salaam kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon se farmaya: Aaraam se raho. Beshak wo Safiya bint Huyayy hain. To un donon ne kaha: SubhanAllah Ya Rasulullah! Aur un par giraan guzra. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak shaitaan insaan mein khoon key pahunchney ki jagah tak pahunchta hai. Aur beshak mujhey khauf hua ke wo tumharey dilon mein kuchh daal dey. (Bukhari: 2035)"
"983","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har Ramazan mein das din etekaaf kartey they. Phir jab wo saal tha jis mein Aap faut huey to Aap ne bees din etekaaf kya. (Bukhari: 2044). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tum kehtey ho ke Abu Hurairah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bahut hadees bayan kartey hain. Aur tum kehtey ho ke Muhaajireen aur Ansaar ka kya haal hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Abu Hurairah ki hadees jaisi hadees bayan nahi kartey. Aur Muhaajireen mein se merey bhaiyon ko baazaaron mein len den mashghool rakhta tha. Aur main pet bhar khaaney par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath rehta tha. To haazir hota jab wo ghaaeb hotey aur yaad rakhta jab wo bhooltey. Aur Ansaar mein se merey bhaiyon ko unkey maalon ka kaam mashghool rakhta tha. Aur main Suffa key miskeenon mein se miskeen aadmi tha. Yaad rakhta jab wo bhooltey. Aur beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik hadees mein farmaya jo Aap bayan kar rahey they: Beshak koi apna kapda na bichhaaeyga yahan tak ke main apni ye baat poori karun, phir use apne paas jama karey magar wo jo main kehta hun yaad rakkheyga. To main ne apne upar namra chaadar bichhaai yahan tak ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni baat poori ki to main ne use apne seeney se jama kar liya. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki us baat mein se kuchh na bhoola. (2047). Ye aam hai aur (apni chaadar bichhao) Abu Hurairah key sath khaas hai. Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Khareed-o-farokht ki kitaab."
